1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,246
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,643 --> 00:00:11,859
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,903 --> 00:00:16,117
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,308 --> 00:00:20,328
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:22,199
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:24,733
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,799 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,971 --> 00:00:28,757
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,424 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,927 --> 00:00:33,321
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,687 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,560
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,716 --> 00:00:47,043
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,043 --> 00:00:48,618
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,618 --> 00:00:49,649
=Episode 2=

17
00:00:50,119 --> 00:00:51,560
I am the Son of Heaven.

18
00:00:52,079 --> 00:00:53,280
No poison can harm me.

19
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,280
Ahem.

20
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,159
You...

21
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:05,079
should go back, Your Majesty.

22
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,879
Rest and recover.

23
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,799
(Cold Palace)
How did she end up like this?

24
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,719
Are all the imperial physicians useless?

25
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,359
Your... Your Majesty.

26
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:22,400
In the Cold Palace...

27
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,760
The decree deposing
her hasn't been issued yet.

28
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:26,519
She is still my empress.

29
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:29,079
I'm the daughter of
a disgraced official.

30
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:31,439
My life is worth nothing.

31
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,480
Your Majesty,

32
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:36,719
just leave me here

33
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,799
in the Cold Palace

34
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:40,079
to fend for myself.

35
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,879
Her Majesty has never known hardship.

36
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,280
Now she can't even get a proper meal.

37
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,400
Please have mercy, Your Majesty.

38
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,719
Send a physician to treat her.

39
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,879
Issue my decree.

40
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:53,760
This courtyard shall receive

41
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,359
all the provisions it is entitled to.

42
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,359
Yes, Your Majesty.

43
00:01:58,879 --> 00:01:59,680
Why do I feel...

44
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,879
Why do I feel...

45
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:03,439
- His voice sounds so familiar.
- Her voice sounds so familiar.

46
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:11,960
My lady!

47
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:15,080
You're incredible!

48
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,919
You actually fooled him!

49
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:17,639
Hah!

50
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:19,560
Some emperor.

51
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,759
My education and insanity
are centuries ahead of yours.

52
00:02:22,759 --> 00:02:23,759
You can't outsmart me.

53
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:26,560
(A little paler.)

54
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,360
Your Majesty.

55
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,080
I have

56
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,759
a dreadful illness.

57
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:39,159
Maybe add some ketchup?

58
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:43,039
His Majesty actually cares about you.

59
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:44,879
That ugly jerk wouldn't be so kind.

60
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,800
He probably just doesn't want me dead.

61
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,400
(Cold Palace)
That smells lovely, my lady!

62
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,240
When did you make this wine?

63
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,080
A few days ago.

64
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,759
The whole yard smells of lotus.

65
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,520
You're so talented, my lady!

66
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,800
Heh-heh.

67
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:04,120
(Looks like my private realm
doesn't just speed up production.)

68
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:06,039
(The quality is far better too.)

69
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,360
Great wine!

70
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,439
My lady, you downed it in one go!

71
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,520
Wine this good will sell itself.

72
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:21,360
Our hard days will soon be over.

73
00:03:23,053 --> 00:03:24,700
(Consort Yao
Wine)

74
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:25,919
Lotus wine?

75
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:28,919
Eunuch Cao is searching everywhere
for the brewer.

76
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,439
Who made it?

77
00:03:30,573 --> 00:03:31,866
(Matron Chen)

78
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:34,280
A lowly eunuch. No threat at all.

79
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:36,120
He could be of use to you.

80
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:37,719
Hmph.

81
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,800
An opportunity like this?

82
00:03:40,479 --> 00:03:42,560
So many eyes in the harem are on this.

83
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:46,000
I'd better make my move first.

84
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,680
Your Majesty.

85
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,199
You've been reading memorials for hours.

86
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:54,360
Have a snack to tide you over.

87
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,759
Have you been drinking?

88
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:59,120
Just a cup at noon.

89
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,879
I deserve death for my misconduct.

90
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,759
(That scent...)

91
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:03,960
(It's familiar.)

92
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,560
Was it lotus wine?

93
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,439
How did you know?

94
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,039
You...

95
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:11,919
Where did you get it?

96
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,280
Palace Service Office.

97
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:16,040
It's all the rage in the palace now.

98
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,360
Delicious and affordable.

99
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:19,120
I couldn't resist,

100
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,279
so I asked for a cup.

101
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,000
Quickly.

102
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,839
Find whoever made that wine.

103
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,600
Yes, Your Majesty.

104
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,519
Your Majesty.

105
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,680
We've found the brewer.

106
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,560
She's waiting outside.

107
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,040
Send her in.

108
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,879
Summon

109
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:36,439
the person waiting outside!

110
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,879
Excellent wine.

111
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,040
Of course.

112
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,680
I made it myself.

113
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:46,439
(I searched for him a
thousand times in the crowd.)

114
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,079
(Then turned around...)

115
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,600
(And there she was...)

116
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,560
Greetings, Your Majesty.

117
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,920
You made this wine?

118
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,680
I did, Your Majesty.

119
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,079
I never knew

120
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,519
you had such a talent, Consort Yao.

121
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:08,120
Oh.

122
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,959
Wine isn't my only talent.

123
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:11,759
I have

124
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:13,759
plenty more surprises

125
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,000
waiting for Your Majesty to discover.

126
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,040
Issue my decree.

127
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:23,639
Consort Yao is gifted and wise.

128
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:25,600
Her lotus wine pleases me greatly.

129
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,319
Reward her with 10,000 taels of gold.

130
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:30,040
Thank you for your generosity.

131
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,360
You may leave.

132
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,759
Yes, Your Majesty.

133
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:37,079
(She haggled over ten taels of silver.)

134
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,639
(Ten thousand taels of gold?)

135
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,639
(She'll surely take the bait.)

136
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:48,120
Making money here is ridiculously easy.

137
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:50,079
I can barely keep up with demand.

138
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,959
Ha-ha!

139
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,399
My lady.

140
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,639
I just heard the news.

141
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,480
His Majesty is looking for the brewer.

142
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,160
Consort Yao took the credit

143
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,600
and received a lavish reward.

144
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:03,040
You're the one who made that wine.

145
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:04,680
Why should she get rewarded?

146
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,319
I'll tell everyone the truth!

147
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,879
Hey, wait!

148
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:09,800
No one would believe you now.

149
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,160
Forget it.

150
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,639
She can have the credit.

151
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:16,079
The money's already in my pocket.

152
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,920
But it's so unfair to you.

153
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:21,040
You work so hard, day and night.

154
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,680
She just says a few words

155
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,199
and gets 10,000 taels of gold!

156
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,000
How much?

157
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,839
Ten thousand taels of gold!

158
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,720
Your Highness.

159
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,240
The brewer is here.

160
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,519
(Cold Palace)
The Cold Palace again?

161
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,000
What rotten luck.

162
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:40,040
What lowly servant has the nerve
to make me come in person?

163
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,920
Eunuchs on duty outside

164
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,160
are too busy to make wine.

165
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,959
I had a hard time finding him.

166
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:47,360
I feared word might get out.

167
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:49,839
I had to ask you to come in person.

168
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:52,240
Well?

169
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:53,519
Recognize me?

170
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,839
Nobody in the palace has seen you.

171
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,160
Not even His Majesty.

172
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:01,600
Well,

173
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,920
this should work.

174
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,600
But I don't understand.

175
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:09,079
Consort Yao wants the lotus wine recipe.

176
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:12,199
Why tip off Consort Lan?

177
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,800
Competition drives up the price.

178
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,920
If I can't keep my recipe,

179
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,399
I'll make her pay dearly.

180
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:22,759
(Consort Lan)
What a coincidence.

181
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:24,040
Fancy seeing you here.

182
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,240
What are you doing here?

183
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:27,040
Whatever you're here for,

184
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,360
I'm here for it too.

185
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,199
I am Xiao Lu.

186
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:38,439
Greetings,

187
00:07:38,439 --> 00:07:39,519
Your Highnesses.

188
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,120
You may rise.

189
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,680
You brewed this wine?

190
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,439
Yes.

191
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,439
I'm sure you know why I'm here.

192
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,879
I want the lotus wine recipe.

193
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:52,040
Name your price.

194
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,519
I wouldn't dare.

195
00:07:53,879 --> 00:07:56,480
I'm honored that something of mine

196
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,759
caught Your Highness's eye.

197
00:07:58,399 --> 00:07:59,439
But

198
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,120
there's only

199
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:02,560
one copy of the recipe.

200
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,160
How about 1,000 silver pieces?

201
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:06,759
I'll take the recipe.

202
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,240
(Once I have it,)

203
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,720
(Consort Yao will be guilty
of deceiving the Emperor.)

204
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:14,360
You dare take what's mine?

205
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,079
How is this stealing from you?

206
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,360
This is fair competition.

207
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:20,399
(Go on, keep fighting!)

208
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,439
(Drive that price right up!)

209
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,040
Two thousand silver pieces.

210
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,319
Two thousand five hundred.

211
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,920
Three thousand.

212
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,399
Three thousand five hundred.

213
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:29,480
Five thousand.

214
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:30,759
Ten thousand.

215
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,240
Fifty thousand.

216
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,919
(I'm rich! I'm rich!)

217
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,879
(Now I can escape the palace)

218
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:39,919
(and give Yinshuang the good life!)

219
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,840
Giving up already?

220
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,559
Did I raise the price too high?

221
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,120
Not enough money?

222
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,879
Since you want it so badly,

223
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:51,480
I'll leave it to you.

224
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,159
Hmph.

225
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,879
As if you could outbid me.

226
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,120
Fifty thousand, once.

227
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,399
Fifty thousand, twice.

228
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:58,600
Sold!

229
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:01,200
Congratulations, Your Highness!

230
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:04,639
The secret lotus wine recipe is yours!

231
00:09:06,759 --> 00:09:07,639
Your Highness.

232
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:09,559
I've written down the recipe.

233
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,639
Keep it safe.

234
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,279
And now, perhaps you could...

235
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:18,159
(It's not even worth a hundred.)

236
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,000
(And it cost me fifty thousand!)

237
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:22,320
Matron Chen.

238
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:26,200
Thank you!

239
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:31,480
(His Majesty arrives!)

240
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,639
Greetings, Your Majesty.

241
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:37,679
Greetings, Your Majesty.

242
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,840
The Cold Palace

243
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,639
has never been so lively.

244
00:09:41,799 --> 00:09:43,039
I heard

245
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:45,279
the crabapple trees here are thriving.

246
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,279
It occurred to me

247
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:48,799
Consort Lan and I
entered the palace together.

248
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,000
I thought she might be lonely,

249
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,080
so I invited her to
join me for a stroll.

250
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,279
Crabapple blossoms?

251
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,799
Where?

252
00:10:00,519 --> 00:10:01,720
Consort Yao, are you planning

253
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,679
to brew peach blossom wine next?

254
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:05,559
What a wonderful idea!

255
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,840
Brewing wine is my specialty.

256
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,399
You can try it in a few days.

257
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,000
Is that so?

258
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,320
Did you really brew this wine?

259
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,210
(Wine)

260
00:10:19,519 --> 00:10:20,879
Why do I hear

261
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,639
this lotus wine

262
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,720
was brewed by someone else,

263
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,440
here in the Cold Palace?

264
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,279
Consort Yao.

265
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:30,759
You bribed the eunuch in charge here,

266
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:31,600
but you forgot

267
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,039
that he serves His Majesty.

268
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,200
That was most unwise.

269
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,279
I was wrong, Your Majesty.

270
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:38,399
I only wanted to please you.

271
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,480
It wasn't just me.

272
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,480
Consort Lan...

273
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:43,639
She came for the wine recipe too!

274
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:44,240
You!

275
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,080
Some rush to take credit before me.

276
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:50,440
Others do all they can to avoid me.

277
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,879
Now I'm truly curious.

278
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,159
Who exactly are you?

279
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,559
(I'm doomed!)

280
00:10:57,679 --> 00:10:59,360
(First the painting, now the wine.)

281
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,120
(If he finds out, I'm finished!)

282
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:04,039
I am terribly ugly.

283
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:07,120
I fear the sight would offend you.

284
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,200
Insolent servant!

285
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:09,960
Did you not hear His Majesty?

286
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,120
Raise your head!

287
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,279
(The eunuch frets
more than the Emperor.)

288
00:11:13,279 --> 00:11:14,600
(That old saying really is true.)

289
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,399
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

290
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:19,799
I slept wrong last night and woke up
with a stiff neck.

291
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:24,519
I can hardly move it.

292
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:29,039
If you won't raise your head,

293
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:30,799
you won't need it anymore.

294
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:58,056
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

295
00:11:58,453 --> 00:12:02,669
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

296
00:12:02,713 --> 00:12:06,927
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

297
00:12:07,118 --> 00:12:11,138
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

298
00:12:11,476 --> 00:12:15,543
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

299
00:12:15,609 --> 00:12:19,790
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

300
00:12:20,234 --> 00:12:23,601
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

301
00:12:24,072 --> 00:12:28,752
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

302
00:12:30,409 --> 00:12:32,556
♪No finery to rival spring♪

303
00:12:32,736 --> 00:12:37,040
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

304
00:12:39,450 --> 00:12:41,196
♪Where is beauty found?♪

305
00:12:41,377 --> 00:12:45,807
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

306
00:12:46,374 --> 00:12:47,941
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

307
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:50,429
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

308
00:12:50,495 --> 00:12:52,576
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

309
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:54,514
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

310
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,386
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

311
00:12:56,623 --> 00:12:59,017
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

312
00:12:59,258 --> 00:13:01,558
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

313
00:13:01,836 --> 00:13:06,160
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
